    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nSuperb Town Centre Location\n\nIdeally positioned in a highly sought after and convenient area of Wexford Town Centre, this attractive two bedroom mid terrace townhouse offers excellent access to a host of local amenities. The main shopping thoroughfare, supermarkets, bars, restaurants and Wexford's picturesque Quay front are all within easy walking distance.\n\nSet within a quiet courtyard development, the property extends to approximately 70 sq.m. and is thoughtfully laid out over two floors. Accommodation briefly comprises an entrance hallway, spacious open plan living/dining area, kitchenette, two generously proportioned bedrooms, master bedroom with ensuite and a family bathroom.\n\nThe property is presented in excellent condition throughout and is ready for immediate occupation, making it an ideal choice for first time buyers, owner occupiers or investors. \nServices include all mains services and electric storage heating.\n\nViewing is highly recommended and is strictly by prior appointment with Auctioneer."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nEntrance Hall - 2.5m x 2.3m\nTiled floors.\n\nSitting Room - 6.6m x 4.28m\nOpen plan living, feature high ceilings, timber floors.\n\nKitchen - 3.25m x 1.8m\nFitted kitchen units, tiled floors.\n\nLanding - \n\n\nBathroom - 3.25m x 1.79m\nWith w.c., w.h.b. and bath.\n\nBedroom - 3.58m x 3.34m\nFitted wardrobes, timber floors.\n\nBedroom - 3.34m x 2.96m\nFitted wardrobes, timber floors.\n\nEnsuite Bathroom - 2.35m x 2.21m\nWith w.c., w.h.b. and shower.\n\n"
      },
